         recommended test: pytest collects the same tests that acceptance check asked to run, with no mismatch between the requested test set and the collected test set.
           inputs:  Force the collection subprocess to write a collected-names file and then exit nonzero, while still having collected test names present in that file. Use a requested test id set where the collected names should match the requested ids if the file is read. The key input characteristic is a nonzero collection exit after partial collection, not a clean success.
